# implementation_plan.mdc

## Implementation Plan (Sprint-Based)

### ✅ Sprint 1: Authentication & Roles
- Implement Supabase Auth integration
- Role management: Admin, Team Lead, User, Guest
- Secure routes with RLS and middleware

### ✅ Sprint 2: Basic Video Management
- `videos` table creation
- Upload & embed YouTube videos
- Admin panel for video CRUD

### ✅ Sprint 3: Category Management
- `categories` table creation
- Assign categories to videos
- Filter videos by category

### ✅ Sprint 4: Video Assignment System
- `video_assignments` table
- Admin & TL can assign videos to users
- Assignment tracking logic
- 🔔 Trigger both in-app notification and email on assignment

### ✅ Sprint 5: Course System
- `courses` table and `course_assignments`
- Add videos to courses
- Track course progress
- 🔔 Notify users via in-app and email

### ✅ Sprint 6: Watch Tracking
- `watch_logs` table
- Track duration watched per video
- Mark video/course as completed

### ✅ Sprint 7: Comment & Feedback System (RFC 007)
- `comments` table
- Enable user comments and feedback type
- Moderation and role-based delete

### ✅ Sprint 8: Reporting Dashboard (RFC 008)
- SQL views for stats: top videos, completion rate, etc.
- Admin/Team Lead dashboard UI

### ✅ Sprint 9: Video Recommendation (RFC 009)
- YouTube API integration
- Suggest 5 videos based on keywords or category
- Show in video/category creation modals

### ✅ Sprint 10: YouTube Insights (RFC 010)
- Fetch viewCount, likeCount via YouTube API
- Store in `videos` table
- Display under video player

### ✅ Sprint 11: Category Enhancements (RFC 011)
- Add `description`, `topic_link`, `helpful_links`, `carousel_order`
- Admin UI to manage ordering & content

### ✅ Sprint 12: Transcript Support (RFC 012)
- Upload `.txt` or markdown transcripts
- Display in collapsible panel
- Add `transcript` and `transcript_file_url` to `videos`

### 🟡 Phase 2 (Post-MVP Enhancements)
- AI Summary from Transcript
- Generate Document from Transcript
- Notion-style AI tools based on transcript text

---

This plan ensures each sprint is focused and builds incrementally toward a robust learning platform. 